    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-code-review",
      "text": "Structured code review skill for DeepSeek Harness."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "Teaches the agent a systematic code review process:\n- Correctness: logic errors, edge cases, error handling\n- Security: input validation, secrets, injection\n- Performance: unnecessary loops, N+1, blocking ops\n- Style: naming, complexity, dead code\n- Testing: coverage, edge cases"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile your-profile add dsh-plugin-code-review\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "Just ask the agent to review code:\n- \"Review this diff\"\n- \"Check this PR for security issues\"\n- \"Review src/auth.ts\""
    },
    {
      "section": "Output format",
      "text": "```\n[CRITICAL] src/auth.ts:42 - Missing input validation on user email\n[WARNING] src/api.ts:18 - Potential SQL injection via string concatenation\n[SUGGESTION] src/utils.ts:7 - Function too long, consider splitting\n```"
    },
    {
